:"Juan Ciscomani is the Republican running for the House in Arizona's district 6. The campaign has raised $6.17M and has $4.14M in the bank. Outside groups have spent $1.41M to help and $3.28M to attack. Campaign health reads 40 out of 100, strained against Joanna Mendoza. Strongest on cash, weakest on activity. Ledger Score is 92, limited data. The biggest flag: Reliance on PAC money. $1.65M from PACs and other committees, 27% of $6.17M raised."}